                  "type": "quiz",
                  "question": "A discharge note reads: 'Patient s/p CABG x3 with BIMA grafts to LAD and Cx. EBL 600 mL. Required temporary IABP intraop. Pacing wires placed. Transferred to CTICU on ventilator, weaned on POD#1. Discharged home on POD#6 with cardiac rehab referral.' Which abbreviation pair is correctly decoded?",
